# rule-30 sweep, 2026-09-20.  PREDICATE, stated because the first attempt
# was a grep for X86_INS_NOP and that finds one SYMPTOM of rule 30, not its
# class: for every PASSING test that decodes a literal byte array and
# asserts a length, disassemble those exact bytes in the test's own mode
# and compare.  An expectation read off the decoder disagrees with objdump;
# one taken from the SDM or an oracle does not.
# Reds are excluded: their expectation IS the oracle and they are meant to fail.

